577
00:35:10,070 --> 00:35:11,030
Oh, Ning-nong.

578
00:35:11,030 --> 00:35:12,730
I have something to tell you, Sarm.

579
00:35:13,020 --> 00:35:13,990
What is it?

580
00:35:14,670 --> 00:35:15,230
So...

581
