590
00:36:03,420 --> 00:36:04,760
spicy salad with salted eggs,

591
00:36:05,170 --> 00:36:06,330
roasted prawns glazed
with toddy palm sugar,

592
00:36:06,350 --> 00:36:08,360
and sweet fried dried fish.

593
00:36:12,930 --> 00:36:14,180
I'll have fried rice with crabs.

594
00:36:15,030 --> 00:36:15,940
Absolutely.

595
00:36:15,940 --> 00:36:17,180
