596
00:36:22,510 --> 00:36:23,880
We're all grownups now.

597
00:36:24,780 --> 00:36:26,740
Don't complicate things.

598
00:36:27,790 --> 00:36:30,270
If you miss him, just go see him.

599
00:36:30,270 --> 00:36:31,850
It's as simple as that.

600
00:36:37,160 --> 00:36:38,360
If I miss him...

601
00:36:38,830 --> 00:36:39,910
I should go see him?

602
00:36:41,710 --> 00:36:42,270
Aunt.

603
00:36:42,270 --> 00:36:42,890
Yes?

604
00:36:42,890 --> 00:36:44,140
I'll have dinner later.

605
00:36:44,850 --> 00:36:45,890
"If I miss him...

606
00:36:45,910 --> 00:36:46,760
I should go see him."

607
00:36:46,970 --> 00:36:48,590
"If I miss him...
I should go see him."

608
