612
00:37:24,470 --> 00:37:25,690
Is that you, Juju?

613
00:37:26,110 --> 00:37:27,230
Juju, it's your papa.

614
00:37:27,940 --> 00:37:28,970
I've come in peace.

615
00:37:29,190 --> 00:37:30,230
Juju!

616
00:37:31,890 --> 00:37:33,790
