636
00:38:10,940 --> 00:38:11,960
Little Jam!

637
00:38:12,170 --> 00:38:13,050
Give me a break.

638
00:38:14,010 --> 00:38:14,850
Little Jam!

639
00:38:15,300 --> 00:38:16,030
Little Jam!

640
00:38:16,030 --> 00:38:16,760
Ow...

641
00:38:17,130 --> 00:38:18,390
Come on, Juju.

642
00:38:18,710 --> 00:38:20,040
Shall we go to bed together?

643
00:38:20,360 --> 00:38:21,380
Little Jam!

644
00:38:22,870 --> 00:38:23,960
Little Jam!

645
00:38:24,670 --> 00:38:25,730
Little Jam!

646
00:38:26,100 --> 00:38:26,860
This is Sarm...

647
00:38:26,970 --> 00:38:28,100
It's me.

648
00:38:30,230 --> 00:38:31,550
- Mr. Sarm?!
- Damn right!

649
00:38:31,930 --> 00:38:32,360
