650
00:38:32,360 --> 00:38:33,560
It's me.

651
00:38:33,560 --> 00:38:34,940
- Wait, wait, wait.
- Yes?

652
00:38:34,940 --> 00:38:35,960
What are you doing?!

653
00:38:36,530 --> 00:38:37,160
I'm...

654
00:38:37,370 --> 00:38:38,360
I'm here to see you, Little Jam.

655
00:38:38,360 --> 00:38:39,560
Gosh...

656
00:38:39,900 --> 00:38:40,760
Get off the gate...

657
00:38:40,760 --> 00:38:41,960
There's so little time left.

658
00:38:42,110 --> 00:38:42,950
I've got something to tell you.

659
00:38:42,950 --> 00:38:44,070
I

660
