- Don't... Don't resist.

690
00:39:19,580 --> 00:39:20,360
- Don't...
- Don't resist. Come with us.

691
00:39:20,940 --> 00:39:22,250
I'm not leaving.

692
00:39:22,250 --> 00:39:24,300
