695
00:39:26,140 --> 00:39:27,950
I did it because my heart told me to do so.

696
00:39:27,950 --> 00:39:28,870
[Traiphop Reveals:
He Was Following His Heart]

697
00:39:29,020 --> 00:39:29,960
