698
00:39:29,960 --> 00:39:32,360
I did it because my heart couldn't take it anymore.
[He Claims He Couldn't Take It Anymore]

699
00:39:33,610 --> 00:39:35,960
I beg Jiranat to listen to me!
[He Begs Jiranat to Listen to Him]

700
00:39:36,770 --> 00:39:37,530
