705
00:39:44,360 --> 00:39:45,560
I love you!

706
00:39:45,560 --> 00:39:47,150
I love you every single second!

707
00:39:47,150 --> 00:39:49,160
I love you with every breath I take!

708
00:39:49,160 --> 00:39:50,100
